{"sections":[{"slug":"幂零根","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"幂零根"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">幂零根</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“幂零根”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">交换环</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">的幂零根为</span>\n$$\r\nI = \\{x\\in R\\mid \\exists n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\,x^n=0\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">的幂零根是</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">的所有素理想的交</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $a\\in R\\setminus I$, <span lang=\"zh\">我们证明存在素理想</span> $\\mathfrak p$ <span lang=\"zh\">不包含</span> $a$. <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $a$ <span lang=\"zh\">不幂零</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">所以环</span> $R[a^{-1}]$ <span lang=\"zh\">非零</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而</span> $R[a^{-1}]$ <span lang=\"zh\">有素理想</span> $\\mathfrak p$. <span lang=\"zh\">这个理想在</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的拉回即为不包含</span> $a$ <span lang=\"zh\">的素理想</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}